  "description": "Harness learning loop (experience_improvement_todo.md Phases 2-4): is the loop working? North stars: correction rate (trending down), % jobs completing without retry, proposals accepted/total. Rows: Jobs (success rate, p50/p95 duration, failures/re-runs), Memory (search hit rate, writeback, errors by op, per-user counts), Capture (sessions ingested by user; per-host breakdown unavailable — sessions_ingested_total is labeled by user_id+status only), Learning (new memories/week, lessons/week, proposals by status), Friction (failures by skill, re-runs by skill, avg completion time). Restart/recreate events are tracked as manual dashboard annotations (no metric source; a docker-events exporter would be a separate project). All series are emitted by skill-runner /metrics (memory, sessions, proposals, jobs_metrics, learning_metrics modules).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "title": "North Star",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Corrections stored by harness_reflection over the last 7 days (north star: trending DOWN as the harness gets better).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 6
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(harness_reflection_maintenance_total{kind=\"correction\"}[7d]))",
          "legendFormat": "corrections / 7d",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Correction rate (corrections / week)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "100% minus the share of jobs that re-ran a previous same (skill, intent) job with a non-empty intent (user-driven retries) over the last 7 days. Scheduled recurring runs are excluded (they are cadence, not retries).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * (1 - (sum(increase(skill_jobs_rerun_total{kind=\"user\"}[7d])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(skill_jobs_total[7d])), 1)))",
          "legendFormat": "% without retry",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "% jobs completing without retry (7d)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
